@* =================================================================================================
   FILE: Maroos.Web/Components/Account/Pages/AccessDenied.razor             URL: /Account/AccessDenied
   ORIGIN: generated by the Blazor Identity template; Maroos uses it unchanged.
   PURPOSE: Shown when a signed-in user asks for something they aren't allowed to see (a role check fails).
   Maroos has no roles, so in practice nobody lands here.
   ================================================================================================= *@
@page "/Account/AccessDenied"

<PageTitle>Access denied</PageTitle>

<header>
    <h1 class="text-danger">Access denied</h1>
    <p class="text-danger">You do not have access to this resource.</p>
</header>
